    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Amounts",
     "texto": [
      "**Porcja** means «portion».",
      "After **porcja**, the food usually takes the genitive: **porcja lodów**, «a portion of ice cream»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Without an ingredient",
     "texto": [
      "**Bez** means «without» and takes the genitive: **bez cukru**, «without sugar»; **bez mleka**, «without milk».",
      "In English the noun doesn't change after «without»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
